  "title": "🎲 WearOS Dice App",
  "date": "2025-07-12T21:00:00.000Z",
  "content": "🎲 WearOS Dice App\n\nIt’s been a while since I last tried making a WearOS app. Last time I checked, the build process was painfully slow, and Android development itself is a bit of a headache 😅.\n\nThis time, I decided to make a simple dice app using ViewModel. Some dependencies need to be added in the build.gradle file — the editor won’t always remind you, but tools like Gemini can help find the right packages.\n\nSending the app to the watch is still a bit painful 😅. Right now I’m using wearos toolbox to install the APK, which makes life a little easier.",
